      "SECTION_15_SWOT": "# Section 15: Institutional SWOT Matrix\n\n| Category | Points |\n|---|---|\n| **Strengths** | High recurring software revenue, negative net debt, pricing power |\n| **Weaknesses** | Premium multiple provides modest margin of safety |\n| **Opportunities** | Enterprise cloud penetration, international expansion |\n| **Threats** | Hyperscaler platform consolidation, macro elongation |\n",
